You were supposed to come something like six months ago.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:28.030
Yeah, but then-

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:29.017
Richard got COVID.

00:02:29.017 --> 00:02:30.630
Yeah.
Yeah.

