So that got delayed

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.110
and then I wasn't sure if you were ever gonna make it out,

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:34.943
but here you are.
But I'm here.

00:02:34.943 --> 00:02:36.759
I'm so delighted to sit with you today.

00:02:36.759 --> 00:02:39.630
I'm delighted to be here I really am.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.833
I haven't been to LA in nearly 20 years.

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:43.846
So it's been really cool.

00:02:43.846 --> 00:02:44.679
Wow.
Yeah.

00:02:44.679 --> 00:02:45.730
Well, you picked a nice moment.

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:48.080
We had some rain the other day, which was very unusual,

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:50.800
but everything's uncharacteristically green.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.300
Yeah.
You must feel very,

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:56.660
much like, it feels like this is the Ireland time of year.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.660
It will quickly turn brown, but right now it's pretty great.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:00.493
It is.

