00:59:32.906 --> 00:59:34.893
So we've got the vasomotor flushes,

00:59:34.893 --> 00:59:38.183
which can be really debilitating for some women

00:59:38.183 --> 00:59:40.383
where you just have this tremendous heat

00:59:40.383 --> 00:59:42.356
going through your body top to bottom,

00:59:43.243 --> 00:59:47.293
sweat like crazy, tends to happen a lot at night as well,

00:59:47.293 --> 00:59:49.184
but it can happen at any time of day.

00:59:49.184 --> 00:59:54.184
Vaginal atrophy is a big one, and it doesn't just mean that,

00:59:54.433 --> 00:59:59.083
you have soreness or some sort of dryness there.

00:59:59.083 --> 01:00:02.419
It can actually be quite severe for some women.

01:00:02.419 --> 01:00:04.363
So vaginal atrophy occurs

01:00:04.363 --> 01:00:06.793
when your estrogen levels are going down

01:00:06.793 --> 01:00:09.973
and it can cause painful sex and dryness,

01:00:09.973 --> 01:00:14.973
but also it can cause severe burning, itching,

01:00:15.133 --> 01:00:17.139
it can hurt to sit down.

01:00:17.139 --> 01:00:20.283
It can, if you had an app episiotomy scar,

01:00:20.283 --> 01:00:21.933
from when you were giving birth,

01:00:21.933 --> 01:00:23.163
they can sort of come open.

01:00:23.163 --> 01:00:24.523
They can split and bleed.

01:00:24.523 --> 01:00:26.313
Like it can be a really severe problem.

01:00:26.313 --> 01:00:28.453
That again is very little talked about,

01:00:28.453 --> 01:00:31.141
but can really impact the quality of life.

01:00:31.141 --> 01:00:34.223
Mood changes can be quite severe.

01:00:34.223 --> 01:00:36.961
Increased anxiety is very real

01:00:36.961 --> 01:00:40.243
and many women will put it down to, oh, I'm just depressed.

01:00:40.243 --> 01:00:42.133
They may think that they need an antidepressant,

01:00:42.133 --> 01:00:45.673
but actually it could be that the hormone changes

01:00:45.673 --> 01:00:47.693
around menopause are responsible for some

01:00:47.693 --> 01:00:49.483
of those changes in mood.

01:00:49.483 --> 01:00:51.813
